              <img src="/media/So-mo/m---th---y-anh-trai.jpg" alt="mo thay anh trai danh con gi" width="745"
                height="456"
                style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto" /><strong><span></span></strong>
            </p>
            <p style="text-align: center">
              <span style="color: #ff0000"><strong>»
